.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH speedqx 1  "speedqx 2.7.4" 
.SH NAME
speedqx \- SpeedQX Internet Speed Test \- QubeTX Developer Tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBspeedqx\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-duration\fR] [\fB\-\-cf\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-ndt\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-latency\-probes\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
SpeedQX Internet Speed Test \- QubeTX Developer Tools
.PP
Dual\-provider speed test using Cloudflare and M\-Lab NDT7.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH OUTPUT
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output results as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\fR
Use ASCII characters instead of Unicode box\-drawing
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colored output
.SH "SPEED TEST"
.TP
\fB\-\-duration\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR [default: 30]
Test duration per provider: seconds or "auto"
.TP
\fB\-\-cf\-only\fR
Use only Cloudflare (skip NDT7)
.TP
\fB\-\-ndt\-only\fR
Use only M\-Lab NDT7 (skip Cloudflare)
.TP
\fB\-\-latency\-probes\fR \fI<LATENCY_PROBES>\fR [default: 20]
Number of latency probes
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  speedqx                Run full speed test (Cloudflare + NDT7)
  speedqx \-\-cf\-only      Cloudflare only
  speedqx \-\-ndt\-only     M\-Lab NDT7 only
  speedqx \-\-duration 60  60\-second test per provider
  speedqx \-\-json         Output results as JSON

Run \*(Aqspeedqx \-\-help\*(Aq for full details, or \*(Aqspeedqx \-h\*(Aq for a summary.
.SH VERSION
v2.7.4
